{"title":"Raider High Chief","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 55 Raider that attacks with slash (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"muted\">None known</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"muted\">None known</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      \n      \n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/dune-whetstone\">Dune Whetstone</a> <span class=\"muted\">(rerolls quality)</span>. A small chance on any kill, far better from elites. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Reforging</a></p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 1 looted corpse recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - in 0% of 1 looted corpses, 4 recorded drops, 496 total, 66–171 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">0% · 0/1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"titanium-torso\" title=\"Titanium Torso - in 100% of 1 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/280b7b80b5d81046f763.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Titanium Torso</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">100% · 1/1</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Superior: 1 of 1</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Percentages are of the corpses whose loot the collector recorded, so kills you did not loot are not counted.</div></div>\n      <h2>Inside dungeons and buildings</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li><b>Sunscald Hold</b> <span class=\"muted\">· 7</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"open-zone\" data-zone=\"-234\">Layout</button></li></ul>\n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><p class=\"muted\">No sightings yet.</p>\n      <h2>Named ones <span class=\"muted\" style=\"font-size:14px\">(1)</span></h2><div class=\"named-grid\"><a class=\"named-card\" href=\"#/npc/kharim-the-sunscald\"><img src=\"data/img/66901fffbf454001df96.webp\" alt=\"\"><b>Kharim the Sunscald</b><span>Lv 55</span></a></div>\n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Raider: <a href=\"#/monster/dune-outrider\">Dune Outrider</a> <span class=\"muted\">(17)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/dune-raider\">Dune Raider</a> <span class=\"muted\">(23)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/dune-marauder\">Dune Marauder</a> <span class=\"muted\">(29)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/dune-warlord\">Dune Warlord</a> <span class=\"muted\">(33)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/dune-skirmisher\">Dune Skirmisher</a> <span class=\"muted\">(37)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/dune-blade\">Dune Blade</a> <span class=\"muted\">(41)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/dune-captain\">Dune Captain</a> <span class=\"muted\">(45)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/dune-sandlord\">Dune Sandlord</a> <span class=\"muted\">(50)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/844f2a77d4518e9428de.webp\" alt=\"Raider High Chief\"></div><h3>Raider High Chief</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td>55 <span class=\"muted\">(seen 55–55)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Raider</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>slash · melee</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>374</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>34.8</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>2750</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack speed</th><td>3.6 s</td></tr><tr><th>Attack range</th><td>1.6</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Aggressive</th><td>Yes (7 tiles)</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Drops gems</th><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><th>Pendant / cape</th><td>Can drop</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Seen</th><td>1 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}